<BaseLayout
  title="Terms and conditions | Rentalsur La Línea"
  description="Terms and conditions of the Rentalsur La Línea holiday rental service."
>
  <LegalPage title="Terms and conditions">
    <p>
      Welcome to our apartment rental service. Before proceeding with your booking, we ask
      that you carefully read and understand the following terms and conditions:
    </p>

    <h2>1. General terms</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Flammable materials, weapons, medicines and any element dangerous to the life and health of people cannot be stored.</li>
      <li>Smoking is strictly prohibited.</li>
      <li>Pets are not allowed. It is prohibited to have animals, reptiles, insects or birds in the apartment.</li>
      <li>It is prohibited to accommodate more people than those declared in the reservation.</li>
      <li>Parents are fully responsible for the behaviour and actions of their minor children. The administration is not responsible for the health and safety of children on the premises of the apartment.</li>
      <li>Guests must treat the apartment property with care and maintain cleanliness and order.</li>
      <li>Littering or polluting the area is prohibited.</li>
      <li>Before turning on the electric kettle, check there is water inside.</li>
      <li>Do not leave electrical heating appliances unattended.</li>
      <li>When leaving the apartment, turn off the lights and air conditioning.</li>
      <li>Do not use the air conditioning with windows and doors open.</li>
      <li>In case of damage to the property, guests will reimburse the cost of the damage. People invited by the main guest are also responsible for damages caused.</li>
      <li>Do not leave children, animals, personal or valuable items unattended (the administration is not responsible).</li>
      <li>It is prohibited to take goods out of the apartment (tables, chairs, mattresses, blankets, towels, bedspreads, bedding, etc.).</li>
      <li>All access elements (wristbands, keys, magnets, cards, etc.) given to you to use the facilities are considered part of the apartment and as such must be looked after and returned upon departure. Failure to return any of these elements will result in a payment of up to €50 per unit.</li>
      <li>Do not leave the keys inside the apartment or in the back of the lock if you are about to leave — the doors lock automatically when they slam shut.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Reservations and payments</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>All reservations are subject to availability and can be made through our online platform or by direct contact with our customer service team.</li>
      <li>Full rental payment is due one week prior to the check-in date. Payments are accepted in cash (with a maximum of €1,000), by credit/debit card or by bank transfer.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. House rules</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We reserve the right of admission and are committed to maintaining a calm and respectful environment for all our guests.</li>
      <li>Parties or events are not allowed in our apartments.</li>
      <li>Noise is not allowed from 10:00 p.m. to 8:00 a.m. Any type of disturbance or excessive noise that disturbs the peace and quiet of the neighbourhood may result in immediate eviction without refund.</li>
      <li><strong>THE USE OF MUSIC OR SHOWS IS ABSOLUTELY PROHIBITED.</strong></li>
      <li><strong>USE AND SALE OF DRUGS AND ACTIONS RELATED TO PROSTITUTION: THE POLICE WILL BE CALLED.</strong></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Electricity consumption</h2>
    <p>
      For stays of 29 days or more, an additional charge for electricity consumption will
      apply. This charge will be calculated based on actual consumption and will be
      collected in cash monthly at our office.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Security deposit / occupancy deposit</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>A security deposit will be required at check-in to cover any damage caused to the apartment during your stay.</li>
      <li>The deposit required to occupy the apartment can vary between €200 and €500, depending on the property and the number of people staying.</li>
      <li>We reserve the right to charge the credit/debit card provided at the time of booking for any damage that may occur to the apartment after your stay if you book through the website and do not leave a deposit before check-in.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>6. Cancellations and refunds</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Cancellation policies will apply as established in the reservation. Refunds will be subject to these policies and at the discretion of management.</li>
      <li>By making a booking with us, you agree to comply with these terms and conditions.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      If you have any questions or need more information, please do not hesitate to contact
      our customer service team. We hope you enjoy your stay with us!
    </p>
